  "description": "Tamp CommandPlan wrapper for Rushstack Heft 1.x, the build orchestrator behind SharePoint Framework 1.22+ and Rush monorepos. Typed build / test / clean / run verbs plus rig-defined phase actions (e.g. package-solution), and a managed dev server (heft start) that waits for real HTTPS readiness, reports its URL and kills its process tree on shutdown. Resolves the project's own pinned Heft and runs it as `node <heft bin>`, never through a .cmd shim and never by downloading it.",
